// X.509 v3 extension-policy vectors for the x509_verify self-test. Each
// blob is a bare `Extensions ::= SEQUENCE OF Extension` — the exact
// element DecodeExtensionSeq() consumes — so the dangerous SHAPES
// (duplicate extension, trailing bytes, truncated inner SEQUENCE,
// unrecognised critical extension) can be tested without minting a
// signed certificate for each one.
//
