// `issuer_at_1` are what IsUsableIssuer() must return for a path
// carrying 0 / 1 certificates below this one. A rejected blob must
// never be a usable issuer, which is the property that stops a
// malformed-duplicate or unknown-critical certificate from being
// promoted to a CA.

